OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FHere are the percentages of A-level
OL,13,Fentries awarded the top grade of A* by
OL,14,Fnation and region in 2026, with the
OL,15,Fequivalent figure for 2025 and the pre-
OL,16,Fpandemic year of 2019:
OL,18,F` North-east England 6.9% (2025: 6.8%;
OL,19,F2019: 6.7%)
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/14
